OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for farmland to be turned
OL,4,Ainto glamping site
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to turn agricultural land near
OL,7,FPeterborough into a four-pod glamping
OL,8,Fsite have been submitted.
OL,10,FThe applicant, Manor Farm, says
OL,11,Fdevelopment of the site in Thornhaugh,
OL,12,Fnear Wittering, is intended as a form
OL,13,Fof farm diversification to help boost
OL,14,Fincome, which will also promote tourism
OL,15,Fin the area.
OL,17,FAccording to the plans, to be
OL,18,Fconsidered by Peterborough City
OL,19,FCouncil, the pods would be serviced by
OL,20,Ftwo part-time staff members and have
OL,21,Fhot tubs, a decking area and five car
OL,22,Fparking spaces.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
