OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for farmland to be turned
OL,4,Ainto glamping site
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe proposal includes new hedgerow
OL,7,Fplanting, wildflower meadow areas, and
OL,8,Fbird and bat boxes.
